OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says unified Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' as he meets
OL,5,AIrish prime minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has arrived
OL,8,Fin Dublin for the start of his two-day
OL,9,Fvisit to the Republic of Ireland
OL,11,FSpeaking to the media alongside
OL,12,FTaoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,13,FMicheal Martin, Trump is asked about
OL,14,Fthe prospect of a unified Ireland
OL,16,FTrump says he doesn't want to "cause
OL,17,Fany problems" but he thinks a unified
OL,18,FIreland would be a "great thing",
OL,19,Fadding "I'd love to see it unified"
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
