OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says unified Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' as he meets
OL,5,AIrish prime minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe will later travel to his golf resort
OL,8,Fin Doonbeg, County Clare, where the
OL,9,FIrish Open golf tournament is being
OL,10,Fheld
OL,12,FIrish authorities have been planning
OL,13,Ffor Trump's visit for months in what
OL,14,Fwill be one of the biggest security
OL,15,Foperations in the history of the state
OL,17,FProtests against the president's visit
OL,18,Fare expected to be held in Dublin and
OL,19,FDoonbeg
